---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Furry Fediverse">
    <main class="p-2 md:p-5 lg:px-60 2xl:px-80">
        <div class="flex flex-col">
            <div
                class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm bg-[#31dcb2] px-4 py-2 rounded-md"
            >
                <a href="/" class="text-[#12384b] font-semibold">Home</a>
                <svg
                    class="w-4 h-4 text-[#12384b]"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                    <path
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-[#12384b] font-semibold">Legal</span>
                <svg
                    class="w-4 h-4 text-[#12384b]"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="currentColor"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                >
                    <path
                        stroke-linecap="round"
                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                        stroke-width="2"
                        d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-[#12384b] font-semibold">Privacy Policy</span>
            </div>

            <div class="py-6 max-w-4xl">
                <h1 class="font-bold text-2xl text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="text-white/50 text-sm mt-1">Effective as of February 01, 2023</p>

                <div class="mt-6 bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-6 border border-white/10 space-y-4 text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
                    <p>
                        Protecting your private information is our priority. This Statement
                        of Privacy applies to
                        <a href="https://cyberfurz.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#31dcb2] hover:underline">cyberfurz.org</a>,
                        related CyberFurz domains, and CYBERFURZ LLC, and governs data
                        collection and usage.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Collection of your Personal Information</h2>
                    <p>
                        In order to better provide products and services offered, we may
                        collect personally identifiable information such as your email
                        address.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        If you directly disclose personally identifiable information or
                        personally sensitive data through public message boards, this
                        information may be collected and used by others.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        We do not collect personal information unless you voluntarily
                        provide it. You may be required to provide personal information
                        when registering for an account, contacting support, making
                        purchases, or using related services.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Use of your Personal Information</h2>
                    <p>
                        Personal information is used to operate and deliver the services
                        you request, and may also be used to inform you about products or
                        services available from CyberFurz and its affiliates.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Sharing Information with Third Parties</h2>
                    <p>CyberFurz does not sell, rent, or lease customer lists to third parties.</p>
                    <p>
                        Data may be shared with trusted partners for operational support,
                        including analytics, communication, customer support, and
                        deliveries. These partners are required to maintain confidentiality.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Personal information may be disclosed without notice where required
                        by law, legal process, or to protect rights, property, and safety.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Automatically Collected Information</h2>
                    <p>
                        Information about your device and software may be collected
                        automatically, including IP address, browser type, domain names,
                        access times, and referring website addresses.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Use of Cookies</h2>
                    <p>
                        This website may use cookies to personalize your experience. You
                        can accept or decline cookies through your browser settings.
                        Disabling cookies may limit some site functionality.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Links</h2>
                    <p>
                        This website may contain links to other sites. We are not
                        responsible for the content or privacy practices of those sites.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Security of your Personal Information</h2>
                    <p>
                        We use safeguards including SSL encryption where applicable and
                        strive to protect personal information from unauthorized access,
                        use, or disclosure.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure, and
                        absolute security cannot be guaranteed.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Right to Deletion</h2>
                    <p>
                        Subject to applicable exceptions and verifiable request
                        requirements, you may request deletion of personal information from
                        our records and from service providers acting on our behalf.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Requests may be denied where retention is necessary for legal,
                        security, contractual, operational, or other lawful purposes.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Children Under Thirteen</h2>
                    <p>
                        CyberFurz does not knowingly collect personally identifiable
                        information from children under the age of thirteen.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">E-mail Communications</h2>
                    <p>
                        We may send email communications including announcements,
                        confirmations, alerts, and promotional content. You may opt out of
                        promotional communications via the unsubscribe mechanism.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Changes to this Statement</h2>
                    <p>
                        This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time. Continued use
                        of the website after updates indicates acknowledgment and acceptance
                        of the revised policy.
                    </p>

                    <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-white">Contact Information</h2>
                    <p>
                        CYBERFURZ LLC<br />
                        1108 East Main St, Ste 906 #3268<br />
                        Richmond, Virginia 23219
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Email:
                        <a href="mailto:support@cyberfurz.org" class="text-[#31dcb2] hover:underline">support@cyberfurz.org</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
